        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/x/f07891/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2011-08-05T22:33:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I hope this is the proper place for this question.</p>\n<p>Card text: At the start your turn, you may put up to 3 cards fro your hand beneath this card<br>\n<span class=\"bbcode-b\">Power:</span> Destroy all cards beneath this card. Bunker deals 1 Target X energy damage where x=  2 times the number of cards destroyed.</p>\n<p>Does Bunker have to use the cannon the same round he charges up? And if not, can he charge for multiple rounds (placing up to 3 cards each round)?</p>\n<p>I know which way I lean, but I was just curious as to the official ruling on the card.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:34:34.083Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 6,
        "reads": 0,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 30.0,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 5019,
        "topic_slug": "bunker-omni-cannon",
        "display_username": "Xargell",
        "primary_group_name": "playtesters",
        "flair_name": "playtesters",
