        "raw": "I hope this is the proper place for this question.\n\nCard text: At the start your turn, you may put up to 3 cards fro your hand beneath this card\n[b]Power:[/b] Destroy all cards beneath this card. Bunker deals 1 Target X energy damage where x=  2 times the number of cards destroyed.\n\nDoes Bunker have to use the cannon the same round he charges up? And if not, can he charge for multiple rounds (placing up to 3 cards each round)?\n\nI know which way I lean, but I was just curious as to the official ruling on the card.",
