        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/5daacb/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-05-28T17:47:17.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Along the same line I also have a question on this card. It says\"At the start your turn, you may put up to 3 cards fro your hand beneath this card\" Does this mean I can put up to three EACH turn? We played last night and a buddy of mine had 12 cards underneath Omni-Blast, so does this mean he can do 24 points of damage or can you only do six max?</p>",
